    "note": [
     {
      "text": "58-year-old male presenting with burning in the chest and stomach after meals for 1 weeks. Character: burning sensation; radiation: up to the throat; aggravated by lying down after meals; relieved by cold milk. Severity 8/10. Associated: sour belching. PMH: Type 2 diabetes for 9 years; Coronary artery disease, stent 8 years ago. Drugs: Metformin 500 mg; Aspirin 75 mg; Atorvastatin 20 mg. Allergy: no known allergies. Family: heart disease. Personal: chews tobacco. Triage: URGENT."
     }
